[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: MIL-STD-498 STD (Software Test Description)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STD-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Software Test Description
STATEMENT: The system shall undergo comprehensive testing including functional, performance, and security testing.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STD-002
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Test Procedures
STATEMENT: The system shall follow standardized test procedures with documented test cases and expected results.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STD-003
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Test Data
STATEMENT: The system shall use representative test data that simulates production conditions.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STD-004
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Test Tools
STATEMENT: The system shall use automated testing tools for efficient test execution and reporting.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.